      "text": {
        "*": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"zh\" dir=\"ltr\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r2372785\">@media all and (max-width:720px){body.skin-minerva .mw-parser-output table.header{display:table!important}}</style>\n<table class=\"ws-header\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%; margin-bottom:0px; border:1px solid var(--border-color-content-added,#93A6C0); background-color: var(--background-color-neutral-subtle,#F9F9F9); color: inherit;text-align:center;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"25%\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"display:inline-block; inline-size:1em;\"></span><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%88%8A%E4%BA%94%E4%BB%A3%E5%8F%B2/%E5%8D%B7103\" title=\"舊五代史/卷103\">卷一百三</a> <span style=\"color:#999\"> ◄ </span>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%88%8A%E4%BA%94%E4%BB%A3%E5%8F%B2\" title=\"舊五代史\">舊五代史</a></b><br />卷一百四\n</td>\n<td width=\"25%\" align=\"right\"><span style=\"color:#999\"> ► </span> <a href=\"/wiki/%E8%88%8A%E4%BA%94%E4%BB%A3%E5%8F%B2/%E5%8D%B7105\" title=\"舊五代史/卷105\">卷一百五</a><span style=\"display:inline-block; inline-size:1em;\"></span>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table style=\"width:100%; background:var(--background-color-progressive-subtle,#F8FCFF); color: inherit;font-size:small; border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-color-content-added,#93A6C0)\" class=\"ws-header\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span style=\"color: #464646;\"><ul id=\"plainSister\" style=\"display:inline-block; font-size:93%; line-height:normal; list-style-type:none; list-style-image:none; list-style-position:outside; border:1px solid var(--border-color-base,#AAA); float:right; clear:right; margin:0.5ex 0.5ex 0.5ex 0.5ex; padding:0.0ex 0.0ex 0.0ex 0.0ex; background-color:var(--background-color-base,#FFFFFF);color: inherit;\"><li class=\"noprint sisitem\"><span class=\"sisicon\" style=\"padding-right:1ex;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/Special:SiteMatrix\" title=\"Special:SiteMatrix\"><img alt=\"姊妹计划\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/81/Wikimedia-logo.svg/20px-Wikimedia-logo.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikisource.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/81/Wikimedia-logo.svg/40px-Wikimedia-logo.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikisource.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1024\" data-file-height=\"1024\" /></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Special:SiteMatrix\" title=\"Special:SiteMatrix\">姊妹计划</a>: <a href=\"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q85509552\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"d:Q85509552\">数据项</a></li></ul></span>\n<table style=\"font-size:0.9em; text-align:left; background:var(--background-color-neutral-subtle,#F9F9F9); float:right;color: inherit;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"color: #999999;\">\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>◎后妃\n</p><p>高祖皇后李氏，晉陽人也。高祖微時，嘗牧馬於晉陽別墅，因夜入其家，劫而取之。及高祖領藩鎮，累封魏國夫人。高祖建義於太原，欲行頒賚於軍士，以公帑不足，議率井邑，助成其事。後聞而諫曰：「自晉高祖建義，及國家興運，雖出於天意，亦土地人民福力同致耳，未能惠其眾而欲奪其財，非新天子恤隱之理也。今後宮所積，宜悉以散之，設使不厚，人無怨言。」高祖改容曰：「敬聞命矣。」遂停斂貸之議。後傾內府以助之，中外聞者，無不感悅。<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r9259658\">.mw-parser-output .nianhao-link a,.mw-parser-output .nianhao-link a:visited,.mw-parser-output .nianhao-link a:hover,.mw-parser-output .nianhao-link a:focus,.mw-parser-output .nianhao-link a.new{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}.mw-parser-output .nianhao-link a:hover .nianhao,.mw-parser-output .nianhao-link a:focus .nianhao{border-block-end-style:solid}</style><span class=\"nianhao-link\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:947%E5%B9%B4_(%E6%8F%90%E5%8F%8A)\" title=\"Category:947年 (提及)\"><span class=\"nianhao\" style=\"border-block-end:1px dotted;\" title=\"947年\">天福十二年</span></a></span>，冊為皇后。隱帝即位，尊為皇太后。<small style=\"color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)\"><span style=\"color:transparent;font-size:0px\">〈</span>（案：以下疑有闕文。據《<a href=\"/wiki/%E8%B3%87%E6%B2%BB%E9%80%9A%E9%91%91\" title=\"資治通鑑\">通鑒</a>》云：隱帝與李業等謀誅楊邠等，議既定，入白太后，太后曰：「茲事何可輕發，更宜與宰相議之。」業時在旁曰：「先帝嘗言，朝廷大事不可謀及書生，懦怯誤人。」太后復以為言，帝忿曰：「國家之事，非閨門所知。」拂衣而出。又云：南北軍遇於劉子陂，帝欲自出勞軍，太后曰：「郭威吾家故舊，非死亡切身，何以至此！但按兵守城，飛詔諭之，觀其志趣，必有辭理，則君臣之禮尚全，慎勿輕出。」帝不從。）<span style=\"color:transparent;font-size:0px\">〉</span></small>\n</p><p>周太祖入京，凡軍國大事，皆請後發教令以行之。是歲，議立徐州節度使赟為帝，以迎奉未至，周太祖乃率群臣拜章，請後權臨朝聽政，後於是稱誥焉。及周太祖為六軍推戴，上章具述其事，且言願事後為慈母。後下誥答曰：「侍中功烈崇高，德聲昭著，翦除禍亂，安定乾坤，謳歌有歸，歷數攸屬，所以軍民推戴，億兆同歡。老身未終殘年，屬茲多難，惟以衰朽，托於始終。載省來箋，如母見待，感念深意，涕泗橫流」云。仍出戎衣、玉帶以賜周太祖。周太祖即位，上尊號曰德聖皇太后，居於太平宮。周<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r9259658\" /><span class=\"nianhao-link\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:954%E5%B9%B4_(%E6%8F%90%E5%8F%8A)\" title=\"Category:954年 (提及)\"><span class=\"nianhao\" style=\"border-block-end:1px dotted;\" title=\"954年\">顯德元年</span></a></span>春薨。<small style=\"color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)\"><span style=\"color:transparent;font-size:0px\">〈</span>（案：隱帝未立皇后，據薛史《張彥成傳》云：隱帝娶彥成女。《楊邠傳》云：隱帝所愛耿夫人，欲立為後，邠以為太速，夫人卒，隱帝欲以後禮葬，邠又止之。蓋隱帝在位三年，崩時年二十，故未及冊立皇后也。又，《<a href=\"/wiki/%E4%BA%94%E4%BB%A3%E6%9C%83%E8%A6%81\" title=\"五代會要\">五代會要</a>》載：漢高祖長女永寧公主，降宋延渥，<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r9259658\" /><span class=\"nianhao-link\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:947%E5%B9%B4_(%E6%8F%90%E5%8F%8A)\" title=\"Category:947年 (提及)\"><span class=\"nianhao\" style=\"border-block-end:1px dotted;\" title=\"947年\">天福十二年</span></a></span>四月封，至<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r9259658\" /><span class=\"nianhao-link\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E6%8C%87%E5%AE%9A%E5%85%AC%E5%85%83%E7%9A%84%E7%B4%80%E5%B9%B4\" title=\"Category:需要指定公元的紀年\"><span class=\"nianhao\" style=\"border-block-end:1px dotted;\" title=\"請指定為“1171年”或“949年”\">乾祐二年</span></a></span>十二月，追封秦國長公主。）<span style=\"color:transparent;font-size:0px\">〉</span></small>\n</p>\n<table class=\"ws-noexport noprint ws-footer\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border:1px solid var(--border-color-content-added,#a3d3ff); background-color: var(--background-color-progressive-subtle,#eaf3ff); width:100%; margin-bottom:0px; text-align:center; color: inherit;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"20%\" align=\"left\">　<a href=\"/wiki/%E8%88%8A%E4%BA%94%E4%BB%A3%E5%8F%B2/%E5%8D%B7103\" title=\"舊五代史/卷103\">卷一百三</a>\n</td>\n<td><span style=\"color:#999\"> ◄ </span>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\"><a href=\"#top\">↑返回頂部</a>\n</td>\n<td><span style=\"color:#999\"> ► </span>\n</td>\n<td width=\"20%\" align=\"right\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%88%8A%E4%BA%94%E4%BB%A3%E5%8F%B2/%E5%8D%B7105\" title=\"舊五代史/卷105\">卷一百五</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r4375040\">.mw-parser-output .licenseContainer{box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:1em;margin-bottom:0.25em;clear:both;width:auto;page-break-before:always;break-before:page}.mw-parser-output .licenseContainer>div:first-of-type{display:table;border:2px solid var(--border-subtle,#8888aa);border-collapse:collapse;border-spacing:0 0;empty-cells:hide;box-sizing:border-box;margin:0 auto 0 auto;width:100%;background-color:var(--background-color-neutral-subtle,#f7f8ff);color:var(--color-base,#202122)}.mw-parser-output .licenseContainer>div:first-of-type>div:first-child{display:table-row-group}.mw-parser-output .licenseContainer>div:first-of-type>div:first-child>div:first-child{display:table-row}.mw-parser-output .licenseContainer>div:first-of-type>div:first-child>div:first-child>div{display:table-cell;padding:5px;vertical-align:middle;width:auto}.mw-parser-output .licenseContainer>div:first-of-type>div:first-child>div:first-child>div:first-child{text-align:left}.mw-parser-output .licenseContainer>div:first-of-type>div:first-child>div:first-child>div:nth-child(2){text-align:center}.mw-parser-output .licenseContainer>div:first-of-type>div:first-child>div:first-child>div:nth-child(2)>div{width:100%}.mw-parser-output .licenseContainer